---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy | Mountains to Coast Travel | Guided Tours";
const pageDescription = "Privacy Policy for Mountains to Coast Travel. Learn how we safeguard your personal information when booking Latin America guided tours and group trips.";
const pageKeywords = "privacy policy, Mountains to travel coast, guided tours, usa guided tours, Latin America group trips, us travel guides";
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  keywords={pageKeywords}
>
  <Header />

  <main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface">

    <!-- Privacy Header Hero -->
    <section class="w-full py-space-xl bg-primary text-surface relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary via-primary/90 to-primary/60"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg pt-12 pb-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary-fixed font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
          <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-surface font-semibold">Privacy Policy</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:font-display-xl md:text-display-xl text-surface font-normal tracking-tight">
          Privacy Policy &amp; Data Stewardship
        </h1>
        <p class="font-subhead text-subhead text-surface/85 mt-3 max-w-2xl">
          We treat your personal data with the same integrity and respect that we bring to our expeditions in the field.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <section class="w-full py-space-2xl bg-surface">
      <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg">
        
        <div class="space-y-space-xl text-on-surface">

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">
              1. What Information We Collect
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-3">
              When you submit a trip reservation or contact inquiry on our website, we collect only the necessary details required to plan your journey:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface pl-4 list-disc">
              <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your full name, email address, telephone/WhatsApp number.</li>
              <li><strong>Travel Preferences:</strong> Desired destinations (Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Guatemala, Panama, Honduras, El Salvador), target departure season, number of travelers, and dietary or special physical considerations.</li>
              <li><strong>Direct Communications:</strong> Notes and questions you share directly with Michael and Maria to customize your itinerary.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">
              2. How We Use Your Information
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Your information is used strictly to provide personalized expedition advice, confirm tour reservations, coordinate private eco-lodge bookings, and communicate itinerary updates. We do not sell, rent, lease, or monetize your personal information to third-party advertisers or automated brokers under any circumstances.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">
              3. Direct WhatsApp &amp; Email Communications
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              If you reach out via our WhatsApp concierge line or email, your messages are handled directly by our founders and expedition guides (Michael &amp; Maria). You can opt out of any communications at any time simply by replying or requesting removal.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">
              4. Data Protection &amp; Security
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              We employ SSL encryption across our entire website to ensure all form submissions and inquiries are transmitted securely. Access to traveler reservation information is restricted strictly to necessary expedition logistics personnel.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">
              5. Your Rights
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              You retain the right to request a copy of the personal information we hold for you, request corrections, or ask for the complete deletion of your records from our systems at any point by emailing <a href="mailto:mheller@mountainstocoasttravel.com" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">mheller@mountainstocoasttravel.com</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Contact box -->
          <div class="pt-space-lg border-t border-surface-container-highest flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="font-label-lg text-primary font-bold">Questions About Privacy?</p>
              <p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant">We are committed to absolute transparency with our travelers.</p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-space-md py-2 rounded-lg font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors shrink-0"
            >
              Get in Touch
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
